000400 AUTHOR.              C HILLES/JIM COFFMAN (MAINTAINER).
000500 DATE-WRITTEN.        8/19/87.
000600 DATE-COMPILED.
000700*INSTALLATION.        GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER - AKRON.
000800*SECURITY.
000900*REMARKS.
      *****************************************************************
001000*D   PATH INQUIRY NUMBER 2.  THIS INQUIRY SHOWS THE DATA FOR
001100*D   1 PATH.  HSOWS THE LEVELS, AND EACH OF THE DEFINITIONS FOR THE
001200*D   PATH (EXPENSE CLASSES, BUDGET NUMBERS, ETC).
      *****************************************************************


